      "title": "maxmind: add optional synchronous lookups",
      "message": "maxmind: add optional synchronous lookups\n\nWhen tshark enables synchronous resolution of IP addresses to names,\nforces calls to maxmind_db_lookup_ipv4()/_ipv6() to block-wait for the\nmaxmind response.\n\nProposed fix for #14691.\n",
      "author_name": "David Perry",
      "author_email": "boolean263@protonmail.com",
